+# Wire Format Policy
+
+This project has no recorded decision establishing a single wire serialisation format. The codebase provides rendering and binding support for several formats (including JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, msgpack, and Protocol Buffers), but no policy or decision document in this repository designates any one of them as the project's chosen wire format.
